(PREFACE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This book had its beginning ten years ago in a series of brief) Tj T*
(discussions supplementing a text used in the class-room. Their purpose) Tj T*
(was to amend certain theoretical views even then generally questioned by) Tj T*
(economists, and to present most recent opinions on some other questions.) Tj T*
(These critical comments evolved into a course of lectures following an) Tj T*
(original outline, and were at length reduced to manuscript in the form) Tj T*
(of a stenographic report made from day to day in the class-room. The) Tj T*
(propositions printed in italics were dictated to the class, to give the) Tj T*
