([Sidenote: Temporary use and permanent possession of agents]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. _The temporary use of materials and power and their sources is) Tj T*
(necessary to bring most enjoyable goods into being._ Indirect goods have) Tj T*
(value solely because they help to get direct goods. The apple-tree is) Tj T*
