(many qualities in the fertile field that _must_ be destroyed when it is) Tj T*
(used. Every economist since Ricardo's time has recognized this, and many) Tj T*
(excuses for the inaccuracy have been given. After every harvest, the) Tj T*
(field is less serviceable than before, and if it is to be of the same) Tj T*
(grade of efficiency, the fertile elements must be restored. We cannot) Tj T*
