(time led to the belief that because of lack of food misery must continue) Tj T*
(among the masses of men. It was thought inevitable that the population) Tj T*
(would continue to increase and food become more scarce. The idea of) Tj T*
(diminishing returns became thus a prophecy of what would happen, a) Tj T*
(social philosophy, that affected the thought of men on every practical) Tj T*
(social question.) Tj T*
