(mountain sides from becoming bare and sterile rocks. So, within the last) Tj T*
(two decades, the people in America have begun to think of forestry. Its) Tj T*
(purpose is to restore the forests to the condition of permanent) Tj T*
(rent-earners, to make the mountains yield not a temporary supply, but a) Tj T*
(perpetual crop of timber.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
