(have only recently been drawn upon. A small city like Ithaca probably) Tj T*
(uses to-day a greater quantity of coal than was used in all Europe two) Tj T*
(centuries ago. The large deposits of coal and their early development in) Tj T*
(England long gave a great advantage to English industry over that of) Tj T*
(other countries. In England, however, has first been felt the fear of) Tj T*
