(concept of money, which is interwoven with every practical and) Tj T*
(theoretical problem in economics. We have delayed to the farthest limit) Tj T*
(the formal recognition of the subject; but we are now approaching the) Tj T*
(question of capital and interest, and it is no longer possible to avoid) Tj T*
(a preliminary consideration of the money concept.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: Exact measurement of utilities is not possible without some) Tj T*
(medium of exchange]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In considering the problem of exchange of consumption goods, we have) Tj T*
