(is taken not because it is wanted for itself, but because it will help) Tj T*
(to get something else that is wanted. To be sure of a ready sale in a) Tj T*
(primitive community it must, however, be something that is generally) Tj T*
(desired. Food and clothing, which supply the fundamental physical needs,) Tj T*
