(purpose. Private property is a favorite object of attack by social) Tj T*
(reformers, but it never can be safely abolished in a civilized state) Tj T*
(until some other incentive is provided, equally effective to make men) Tj T*
(subordinate present desires to future welfare. Unless the mass of men) Tj T*
(can be greatly changed, property creates the only motive that can induce) Tj T*
(saving regularly and on a large scale. It diffuses responsibility for) Tj T*
(present consumption. It multiplies the motives for abstinence and thus) Tj T*
(increases the welfare of all economic society.) Tj T*
