(welfare. Not least is the business enterpriser, whose function is to) Tj T*
(direct the economic forces for production. It is vain to assign a mean) Tj T*
(place to the organizing intelligence and its social work. Its importance) Tj T*
(grows apace with the growing magnitude and complexity of industry.) Tj T*
(Misjudgment now will destroy more wealth, and wise judgment can produce) Tj T*
(larger results, than ever before. The captain of industry also may work) Tj T*
