(becomes relatively more important._ The first and simplest advantage of) Tj T*
(association is working in unison. Men unite their muscular efforts for a) Tj T*
(single task, and accomplish what is impossible to them working singly.) Tj T*
(But when many work in unison, the right selection of time and way is of) Tj T*
