(influences is necessary; but in general a superficial view of value is) Tj T*
(taken in business; it does not pay to do other. The logical treatment,) Tj T*
(however, must go deeper into the question and trace the cost of agents) Tj T*
(back to the ultimate cause of value, that is, to want-gratifying power.) Tj T*
