(1. _The term monopoly is used loosely and in many senses._ In popular) Tj T*
(discussion monopoly means almost any wealthy corporation or the power) Tj T*
(the corporation possesses, a power which is usually thought of as) Tj T*
(oppressive. Even economists have held the vaguest ideas regarding) Tj T*
(monopoly. The recent rise of trusts and monopolies has given a large new) Tj T*
(body of facts bearing upon the subject, but all the resulting discussion) Tj T*
(by the public and by economists has not brought agreement upon a) Tj T*
(definition entirely satisfactory. When usage has not settled upon any) Tj T*
(one meaning, the selection of a definition is in a measure arbitrary,) Tj T*
(though it may be guided by logic and considerations of expediency. Let) Tj T*
(us state the various meanings and indicate the one adopted in this) Tj T*
(discussion.) Tj T*
