(2. _Monopoly should not be used as synonymous with scarcity._ Scarcity) Tj T*
(is the essential condition of all value. The simplest things--bricks,) Tj T*
(sand, the commonest unskilled labor--would have no value were there not) Tj T*
(a degree of scarcity relative to the wants that may be gratified.) Tj T*
