(bank money, national expansion, and over-confidence, possibly in some) Tj T*
(degree the heedless financial measures of Andrew Jackson. The crisis of) Tj T*
(1857 followed a period of great prosperity marked by the discovery of) Tj T*
(gold in California in 1848, by great expansion of commerce, by the) Tj T*
