(affecting general prices of commodities. Various novel features in the) Tj T*
(situation make prophecy difficult, but a period of liquidation and lower) Tj T*
(prices appears to be at hand.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Footnote 3: These statements are retained as they were made in March,) Tj T*
(1903. In the following September occurred a very remarkable panic in) Tj T*
(stocks which had the minimum of effect on general business. While stock) Tj T*
