(behind this impersonal phase of rent. The income arising from goods goes) Tj T*
(to the de facto owner of the goods. We do not ask how the goods first) Tj T*
(came into his possession, whether through labor or as a gift, whether) Tj T*
(stolen or inherited. Indeed, the economic theory of competitive rent may) Tj T*
