(much social justification for permitting families to maintain an) Tj T*
(accustomed standard of comfort. Few would deny that a moderate provision) Tj T*
(by parents to provide education and opportunity for their children is) Tj T*
(commendable and desirable. But the evil effects of waiting for dead) Tj T*
(men's shoes are proverbial. Many a boy's greatest curse has been his) Tj T*
(father's fortune. Men of native ability wait idly for fortune to come,) Tj T*
(and opportunities for self-help slip by unheeded. The world often) Tj T*
(exclaims over the failure of the sons of noted men to achieve great) Tj T*
(things, for, despite confusing evidence, men still have faith in) Tj T*
