([Sidenote: Loss of wealth in an isolated or an exchanging economy]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. _The accidental destruction of wealth is a loss to the owner, rarely) Tj T*
(with benefit, on the whole, to others._ In the consumption of wealth the) Tj T*
(loss of its utility is accompanied by the gratifying of wants; in the) Tj T*
(destruction of wealth utility is lost without the gratifying of wants.) Tj T*
(In a simple society, without exchange, the result of such a loss is) Tj T*
(evident. If food is destroyed, men suffer from hunger or gratify) Tj T*
(appetite less perfectly; if clothing is destroyed, they are cold; if) Tj T*
(houses are destroyed, they have no shelter. Likewise, if the) Tj T*
(self-sufficing family on a farm loses wealth by fire or storm or blight,) Tj T*
(its economic environment is made less fitted to gratify wants. In the) Tj T*
(conditions of our society, where goods are exchanged, the result appears) Tj T*
(to be different. The need to replace the lost goods makes a demand for) Tj T*
(special kinds of labor or goods. There may be, therefore, an immediate) Tj T*
(benefit to some, which obscures the corresponding loss to others. If a) Tj T*
(part of the income of the loser must be diverted from other uses to) Tj T*
(replace the wealth destroyed, those from whom he would have bought) Tj T*
(suffer an unexpected falling off of their sales, and he has himself) Tj T*
(gained nothing. The net result is a loss of wealth and gratification to) Tj T*
(the community as a whole.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(There is a real exception where the accidental destruction removes some) Tj T*
(social difficulty. The great fire in London and the great fire in) Tj T*
(Chicago resulted in wonderful improvement. When an old city is built) Tj T*
(almost entirely of wood, each owner may think it to his interest to keep) Tj T*
(the old buildings. A great fire sweeps them all down and compels the) Tj T*
(rebuilding of the city on a new and higher standard. But the usual) Tj T*
(social result of accidental destruction is a loss. It is a use of wealth) Tj T*
(without a fulfilling of the purpose of production, the gratifying of) Tj T*
(wants.) Tj T*
