(expenditure would give? Ostentation has its penalties. Undue striving) Tj T*
(after effect defeats its own purpose. This is the cold fact of) Tj T*
(experience, not a speculative proposition. To get back to the) Tj T*
(fundamental principle: gratification results from a harmonious relation) Tj T*
(between man's nature and the world. Life loaded with too much luggage) Tj T*
