(CHAPTER 42) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DISTRIBUTION OF THE SOCIAL INCOME) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(§ I. THE NATURE OF PERSONAL DISTRIBUTION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: Definition of personal distribution reviewed]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. _Personal distribution, in economics, is the reasoned explanation of) Tj T*
(the ways in which income is divided among the members of the community._) Tj T*
(Before noting more exactly the ways in which distribution can and does) Tj T*
(take place, it may be well to review briefly some definitions that have) Tj T*
(been given in other connections. Distribution is bound up in practice) Tj T*
(with production, but it can be thought of as a more or less distinct) Tj T*
(problem. Functional distribution is the attribution of value to agents) Tj T*
(or classes of producers, to land, machinery, and labor considered) Tj T*
