(answer the question: "Why does man attach value to certain things and) Tj T*
(actions; why does he measure them in certain ratios as expressed in) Tj T*
(terms of each other; and why do these ratios change with changing) Tj T*
(conditions?" This purpose has determined the order of our study.) Tj T*
