(great, in some respects increasing during the seventeenth and eighteenth) Tj T*
(centuries, in France, Holland, and England. The regulation before) Tj T*
(attempted by towns and villages was employed on a larger scale by) Tj T*
(national governments with their commercial systems. The colonies in) Tj T*
(America were used for the economic ends of the "mother countries" and) Tj T*
