(best efficiency for all will follow; it is the belief that the economic) Tj T*
(interests of all men are in harmony. The most striking evidence in) Tj T*
(support of this thought is the stimulating effect of self-interest) Tj T*
(freely working in the field of competition. Each strives to do what will) Tj T*
(bring him the largest return, and the price others pay measures their) Tj T*
(estimate of the service. Each seeking his own interest is led to make) Tj T*
