(under all conditions, instead of what it is, an index to the working of) Tj T*
(one condition at a time. The foregoing objections need but to be further) Tj T*
(analyzed to show that in each of them it is not merely the quantity of) Tj T*
(money, but a number of other factors that differ in each of the) Tj T*
(propositions. We may note briefly in turn the defects in the arguments) Tj T*
(of the preceding paragraph.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: Not a per capita rule]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(First, the quantity theory does not remotely imply that prices in) Tj T*
