(money in circulation. The actual bank-notes of the leading countries) Tj T*
(are thus of many varieties. The Canadian notes are the most nearly) Tj T*
(typical bank-notes issued to-day; those of Germany come next, while) Tj T*
(those of the United States have little of the typical character.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
