(states of the Union the dominant educational force. Moreover, taxation) Tj T*
(often is used as a means not merely of raising revenue, but of) Tj T*
(discouraging one kind of industry and encouraging another. One industry) Tj T*
(wanes or dies under increasing burdens, another waxes strong by) Tj T*
