(production]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. _Shifting of the limits of state action and corresponding changes in) Tj T*
(the weight of taxation are constantly affecting value and incomes._) Tj T*
(Society as a whole is made up of many groups of industry. Government is) Tj T*
(the largest of these, collecting and expending more than any individual) Tj T*
(or corporation. Government is in one aspect a consumption good. In) Tj T*
(return for its collective cost men collectively get the enjoyment of) Tj T*
(social organization, markedly in contrast with the uncertain ties and) Tj T*
(hazards of primitive communities. But government becomes also a mode of) Tj T*
(social investment, an indirect agent, a productive enterprise. Wealth) Tj T*
(applied through it secures a greater product than is possible by) Tj T*
(individual action. Government can maintain lighthouses more economically) Tj T*
(than individuals could otherwise secure them.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
