() Tj T*
(But when the government undertakes these various tasks, the expense) Tj T*
(falls unequally on individuals and affects differently their incomes.) Tj T*
(When free schools take the place of private schools, the law compels) Tj T*
(every one to contribute to education. To many individuals it is a matter) Tj T*
