(day-laborer's family of twelve. The average result may be right, but) Tj T*
(individuals diverge from the average and thus have constantly a motive) Tj T*
(to attempt to change the limits of governmental action. Happily the) Tj T*
(subject is not always viewed with selfish eyes. The ethical and) Tj T*
(patriotic thought is not, "How will this affect my interests?" but, "How) Tj T*
