(millions of dollars. When recently the tax on tea was increased in) Tj T*
(England, all dealers who had accumulated a stock before the law went) Tj T*
(into effect were gainers. Every change in taxation inevitably affects,) Tj T*
(either favorably or unfavorably, many interests. The chance to) Tj T*
