(of the world, but it has not overtaken the progress in resources. The) Tj T*
(rate of increase of population is slackening. The result of this) Tj T*
(combination of events has been a general rise of the conditions making) Tj T*
(for popular welfare. Despite the problems and the abuses that every new) Tj T*
