(centuries. The force in Mount Pelée, if chained and utilized, would run) Tj T*
(a million factories a million years. It is not too much to hope that) Tj T*
(engineering skill will some day reach and utilize these sources. Such a) Tj T*
(cheapening and diffusion of power would put a new face on many of the) Tj T*
(problems of industry. New sources of materials undoubtedly will be) Tj T*
